---
import { BENCH, DOCS } from "~/content/site";
---
<section id="benchmarks" class="section relative overflow-hidden">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 opacity-50 pointer-events-none" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 100%, oklch(70% 0.18 195 / 0.08), transparent 60%);"></div>
  <div class="container-x relative">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="pill mx-auto"><span class="dot"></span>Benchmarks</span>
      <h2 class="reveal mt-5 text-[clamp(36px,5vw,64px)] leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.04em]">
        Evidence before<br /><span class="text-ink-400">performance theatre.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal reveal-delay-1 mt-5 text-[17px] text-ink-300">{BENCH.intro}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="card p-6 sm:p-8 lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-flame-300">What a defensible run records</div>
        <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          {[
            ["Detector", "regex or the pinned local GLiNER2 adapter"],
            ["Model", "revision and snapshot digest"],
            ["Corpus", "licensed fixture and dataset revision"],
            ["Runtime", "Python, Torch, hardware, thresholds, and seed"],
          ].map(([label, value]) => (
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-4">
              <div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-500">{label}</div>
              <div class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.5] text-ink-200">{value}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-400">The repository does not turn an old or unreproducible number into a current product promise. Run the harness, save its machine-readable output, and publish standard precision, recall, F1, and latency alongside the Redax commit.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-400">Run it yourself</div>
        <pre class="mt-5 rounded-xl bg-ink-1000/60 border border-white/[0.05] p-4 overflow-x-auto text-[12px] leading-[1.7] font-mono text-ink-100"><code>python scripts/run_bench.py \
  --corpus tests/fixtures/redactionbench \
  --detector regex \
  --output /tmp/redax-bench.json</code></pre>
        <a href={DOCS.bench} class="btn-ghost mt-6 w-full justify-center">Read the methodology
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
